{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/.github/commits/HEAD", "fetched_at": 1795289732.015695, "data": {"sha": "27299edc01c421fc2527b2bb788ca82af7c598ab", "node_id": "C_kwDODOo9FNoAKDI3Mjk5ZWRjMDFjNDIxZmMyNTI3YjJiYjc4OGNhODJhZjdjNTk4YWI", "commit": {"author": {"name": "sentry-junior[bot]", "email": "264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-11-20T17:10:32Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-11-20T17:10:32Z"}, "message": "fix(warden): Review PRs on the stacked action (#233)\n\nOpening a PR into a stack also sends a stacked pull_request event.\nRulesets ignore the workflow's types filter, so it runs Warden too, shares\nthe review's concurrency group and can cancel the opened review. It then\nmatched no triggers and posted neutral checks over earlier results.\nTreat stacked as a review action so whichever run survives reviews.\n\nCo-authored-by: sentry-junior[bot] <264270552+sentry-junior[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Lorenzo Cian <17258265+lcian@users.noreply.github.com>", "tree": {"sha": "7d94c20ba43f01d8034b331881c07286c0041551", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/.github/git/trees/7d94c20ba43f01d8034b331881c07286c0041551"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/.github/git/commits/27299edc01c421fc2527b2bb788ca82af7c598ab", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJrAH8ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAad8QADneUE8bw7o3fg/wUn81ZYf9\npcKyZYbpJh762qgSFqy3b33wag/RKIWu9fOX2QRIn91enON8UUqHHRT+dLjHLy+x\n3s1Tg/3moe50mTfPoJrPMsmPCdCd/od4rZ/qcWpEqc6DyTh3vWnZrphShurh3MWU\nBYnCvU43hPC6DFBAqk8LO1+GSDaveb51liFh3voROjzqS2d3VtBq8r+LRF6OS5QR\nVZE+Ymhz7M3XyxhokKguI9AEIuMT3emirBTzmSe9h+ZQtgAaMCob5285jwipzLhL\nlV7pohve7/YknlWsxeH2LFydNqlpTjRnVG1fja37nsVx/A9YNk/LXyRzCWwT2qwy\nMyOAimtH+a2A8/1MHmEiZZc7hebnGUZSWSncCvEQFTsRx+I3Ft3B24zkSyepCipq\n9e+V3TyUKMBFMYgqkydAcjGHmUBVB6Cwp/XSdffFfmfP7MuFKiiC